title: A test of a containers folder needs a container that is not above the node.
pid: 56911182-9880-4beb-8a14-ccf6942ad5ba
body: |2-
  A node whose only container is its view-parent gets no containers folder, and
  in the diff view a node whose only changed container stands above it gets none.
  A fixture that means to show such a folder must give the node a second
  container, outside its ancestry.
